### ========================================
### Spring Boot Todo API Test
### ========================================


### 1. POST - Todo 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring Boot 과제하기",
  "completed": false,
  "priority": 1
}


### 2. POST - Todo 완료 처리
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1/complete


### 3. GET - 전체 Todo 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos


### 4. GET - 특정 Todo 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1


### 5. PUT - Todo 내용 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring Boot 과제 완료하기",
  "completed": false,
  "priority": 2
}


### 6. PUT - Todo 우선순위 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1/priority?priority=5


### 7. DELETE - 특정 Todo 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1


### 8. DELETE - 전체 Todo 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos


### ========================================
### HTTP Response Code Test
### ========================================


### 400 Bad Request - title 누락
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "completed": false,
  "priority": 1
}


### 404 Not Found - 존재하지 않는 Todo
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos/999


### 500 Internal Server Error
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos?mode=error


### 503 Service Unavailable
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos?mode=maintenance

